LOCATION:Conference & Event Services\, TCNJ
DESCRIPTION:SCALE: minor\n\nExternal tabling is governed by TCNJ's Use of C
 ampus Property Policy\, which explicitly covers 'members of the general pu
 blic' and comes with a campus-property map and application form on PolicyS
 tat. Event logistics go through Conference & Event Services at ces.tcnj.ed
 u. Ops contact erdiei1@tcnj.edu\, 609-771-3353. Separately\, the Career Ce
 nter's Vendor/Resource Request Form gets a resource listed on their site -
  it is NOT a tabling permit.\n\nOUTREACH NOTE: The Career Center refuses c
 ommission-only\, MLM\, upfront-fee\, home-based and international-position
  employers - check Nascent Materials' framing against that list. New emplo
 yer contact: Joseph Pietromonico.\n\nSOURCE: https://ces.tcnj.edu/\n\n(Com
 piled 2026-08-10. Verify before acting.)
